<body>
    <h1>Meeting Minutes of 2026/07/13 - Rehearsal</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p local-id=3D"71f297359728">Hi all,</p>
<p local-id=3D"0f6d1958e9b9">&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"6de46868f894">Thank you so much for your attendance. Please =
kindly check the meeting minutes below for the meeting.</p>
<p local-id=3D"6021df0496e1">&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"2ea80d1b11f8">Date: Monday, 13<sup>th</sup>&nbsp;July, 2026<=
/p>
<p local-id=3D"feba9607426a">Time: 17:30 HK time</p>
<p local-id=3D"4495626bdc99">Attendees: Lark Jiang, Suker, Loura Guo, Tao H=
uang, Jiajin Zhong, Daijiang Xie, Yixi Wang, Suijie Song, Guangyuan Mu, Hui=
fang Liu, Jiaxing Dai, Shu Cheng</p>
<p local-id=3D"9009ba6199b0"><strong>Quick Recap</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"ea48593f3506">Today, team held a rehearsal for Checkpoint 1.=
 After presentation, the mentors provided constructive feedback. We then ha=
d a productive discussion about the project's ambition and its unique value=
 proposition.</p>
<p local-id=3D"be94d6d1f85e"></p>
<p local-id=3D"66efd68e675b"><strong>Discussion Summary</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"b1d51d0f-fa2d-4e65-ab0a-c2dbb6d1f677">
<li local-id=3D"b616415c-83d6-4356-9e14-190ae15da15e">
<p local-id=3D"572735ea06bf">The presentation duration still needs to be cu=
t to 9 minutes or less.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"61c14cab-e180-43f0-8537-f1a9353229a9">
<p local-id=3D"358692638d8f">The&nbsp;overall visual should be clear for ev=
eryone in the room. Font styles and colors need to be more distinguishable.=
</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6de9711a-0bf3-4014-8555-0235017b3301">
<p local-id=3D"d776fabbb42e">Different points should be clearly separated =
=E2=80=94 for example, by using bold text for key takeaways.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"eaaf46b0-9929-4bc2-b2c8-9f077b0740dd">
<p local-id=3D"4f7d7c8fad4f">The demo use case should be replaced with one =
that is more relevant to banking scenarios. Additionally, a pre-recorded de=
mo video would be more reliable than running it live on site.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"14a24f96-cb91-4e73-aa1f-d8955f75d607">
<p local-id=3D"a53a04e2afbd">The unique value proposition of our project sh=
ould be clearly highlighted throughout the presentation. We should also und=
erscore our future ambition and long-term vision.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d3b7f6f5-12b6-4021-bd61-d54fff06a27c">
<p local-id=3D"f7e43701af28">For future improvements, we can explore both r=
esearch-oriented and product-oriented directions. Update your thought on Co=
nfluence.</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"f9f20b2c8a85"><strong>Action Items</strong></p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"6636c205-5348-4aa4-80a0-7660e68006b9">
<li local-id=3D"127a53f3-4717-439d-9205-a09a9fb1f3fc">
<p local-id=3D"8ddc23344c9c"><strong>All team members=EF=BC=9A</strong>Arri=
ve at Taikoo Hui first floor this friday at 1:30 pm.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"963b26f0-cef4-43a0-a8eb-c390e1831561">
<p local-id=3D"f0cf6263f1e7"><strong>All team members=EF=BC=9A</strong>Upda=
te your thought about improving the chatbot in multiple directions.</p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"5edf66e9-af6d-490e-a294-2dafafdfa0f9">
<p local-id=3D"e0863246c51f"><strong>Yixi Wang: </strong>Polish up the pres=
entation and find a time to present to Tao.</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"d5598cea0ecf">Hi Jiajin and Daijiang,</p>
<p local-id=3D"aa2326369741">&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"0844ef1d070b">Kindly remind you that Jiajin will be the host=
 and Daijiang will be the MoM Noter of next weekly meeting. Please read abo=
ve Notes and get prepard.</p>
<p local-id=3D"e10ebe04cfef"></p>
<p local-id=3D"db0857d7b81e">Kind regards,</p>
<p local-id=3D"7f783ddfa150"></p>
<p local-id=3D"189986e47861">Jiajin Zhong</p>
    </div>
</body>
